#
# Colorsets can be used to configure the color of the various
# parts of fvwm such as window decor, menus, modules, etc.
#
#  Colorset Convention
#
#   0 - Default
#   1 - Inactive Windows
#   2 - Active Window
#   3 - Inactive Windows Borders
#   4 - Active Windows Borders
#   5 - Menu - Inactive Item
#   6 - Menu - Active Item / FvwmBar Hover
#   7 - Menu - Grayed Item
#   8 - Menu - Title
#   9 - Reserved
#  10+ Modules
#      10 - Module Default
#      11 - Module Hilight
#      12 - Module ActiveButton (Mouse Hover)
#      13 - FvwmPager Active Page
#      14 - FvwmIconMan Iconified Button
#      15 - FvwmPager Window (Inactive)
#      17 - FvwmBar Clicked / FvwmIconMan Active Window
#      18 - FvwmBar Start Button
#      19 - FvwmBar CPU
#      20 - FvwmBar RAM
#      21 - FvwmBar Disk
#      22 - FvwmBar 90-100% battery
#      23 - FvwmBar Normal Battery
#      24 - FvwmBar LOW battery
#      25 - FvwmBar Connected Network
#      26 - FvwmBar Disconnected Network
#      27 - FvwmBar Power Button
#      28 - FvwmBar Power Button Hover
#      29 - FvwmBar Power Button Press
#      30 - Rofi Replacement Menu Scheme
###########
